157 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Owing to the shape and size of the device, it eases anxiety by acting as a huggable companion. This provides a sensation of support around bedtime and a cue of positive valence.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
