224 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (After this elaboration of the theory behind Somnox and its scientific backing, the following section provides an overview of how it is put into practice by presenting an overview of studies conducted specifically on Somnox and its effectiveness in treating insomnia symptoms.)
/Pg 19 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
