234 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (Since publication of these studies, Somnox 2 has been launched with significant improvements to the algorithm and sensory experience of the device. In the development of this next generation of Somnox, feedback from the participants of the above-mentioned mixed-method study was implemented,  and several shortcomings of the previous model were addressed.)
/E (Since publication of these studies, Somnox 2 has been launched with significant improvements to the algorithm and sensory experience of the device. In the development of this next generation of Somnox, feedback from the participants of the above-mentioned mixed-method study was implemented,  and several shortcomings of the previous model were addressed.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
